<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/13/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Married Women (Amendment) Act 1994."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/13/eng@> .
