<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/13/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Married Women Act 1957, which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended by inserting after section 4 the following section: 4A. A husband or a wife shall be entitled to sue each other in tort for damages in respect of injuries to his or her person, as the case may be, in the like manner as any other two separate individuals.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/13/eng@> .
