<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/13/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 9 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following: \"(2) A husband or a wife shall be entitled to sue each other in tort for the protection or security of his or her property, as the case may be.\". BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/13/eng@> .
